    "long_instructions": "## Debug the Fitness Tracker\r\n\r\n1. Click each button and observe how the tracker’s state changes.\r\n2. Compare what happens to what the hints say *should* happen.\r\n3. Find bugs where the state:\r\n   - doesn’t change  \r\n   - changes the wrong way  \r\n   - resets  \r\n   - behaves strangely  \r\n   - shows the wrong value  \r\n4. Record each bug in `documentation.md`.\r\n5. Fix the code in `script.js` and test again. Each time AI generates code, ask:\r\n    - Is the output what I asked for?\r\n    - Does it work?\r\n    - Can I explain it?",
    "display_name": "Fitness Tracker",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/24177b03713b2006ef202dfc46f85ac9-steps-icon.png",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Track steps, water, and workout streaks as you interact with the app. Debug how each action updates your daily fitness progress.",
    "require_edit_to_continue": "false",
